Steps for deploying project on aws using docker
1. create dist folder in frontend by running cmd - npm run build
2. copy dist file to backend by creating a public folder in backend and paste inside it
3. next use middleware in backend - app.use(express.static("public"))


Main part:

1. FROM node:20-alpine
2. copy ./Backend .
3. RUN npm install
4. CMD["node","server.js"]